17:T487,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does it cost to live in Italy as a student?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"There is no single amount. Housing, city, lifestyle and scholarship services produce large differences, so build a city-specific monthly and arrival budget."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Milan more expensive for students?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Housing demand often makes Milan a higher-budget destination than many smaller cities, but the actual room, commute and scholarship support determine the final cost."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does a DSU scholarship cover all living costs?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not automatically. Benefits and payment timing vary by region, student status and current call. Compare cash, meals, accommodation and uncovered costs separately."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Should I include part-time work in my budget?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Treat unconfirmed work income as a possible later benefit, not as the money required for visa, travel or the first months."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"$undefined","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/cost-of-living-in-italy-for-students/\",\"name\":\"Cost of living in Italy for international students\",\"description\":\"Estimate student living costs in Italy for rent, food, transport, insurance and arrival expenses, with city-level planning and a free calculator.\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/cost-of-living-in-italy-for-students/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-02\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-13\",\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/programme-research-editorial.webp\"